        "title": "Build the Smallest Chemistry Prototype",
        "action": "Create 8-10 canonical element graphs, arrange them in a standard mini-table and one alternative view, then build CO2, N2, water, and ethene molecule graphs using semantic single/double/triple bond edges.",
